<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan gold prices seen mixed on low demand.</title>
<headline>Pakistan gold prices seen mixed on low demand.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan gold prices are likely to remain mixed in the week starting Monday due to lower demand for gold, dealers at the Karachi Sarafa (bullion) market said.</p>
<p>&quot;The demand from jewellers is low and may keep the prices slightly depressed,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>Gold 24 carat in rupees per 10 grammes</p>
<p>							 Monday     March 31</p>
<p>							 4,694	4,706</p>
<p>    Silver per 1,000 grammes		   7,715	7,715</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
